			"date": "2025-07-25T14:37:56.090Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@ardouglass\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>ardouglass</span></a></span> so basically, I had the library and test suite already ready, just needed to make some small changes in the library for RFC 9557 compat (and to save ~55KB over the full Temporal polyfill lib)</p>",
